      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider the augmented grammar with {+, *, (, ), id} as the set of terminals.\nS' → S\nS → S + R | R\nR → R * P | P\nP → (S) | id\nIf I0 is the set of two LR(0) items {[S' → S.], [S → S. + R]}, then goto(closure(I0), +) contains exactly ___ items.",
