      n: 47,
      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider the following languages:\nL1 = {aⁿwaⁿ | w ∈ {a,b}*}\nL2 = {wxw^R | w,x ∈ {a,b}*, |w|,|x| > 0}\nNote that w^R is the reversal of the string w. Which of the following is/are TRUE?",
